//   minimum altitude for night): https://www.faa.gov/regulations_policies/handbooks_manuals/aviation/faa-h-8083-25c.pdf
// Airplane Flying Handbook, FAA-H-8083-3C. In the 3C edition night operations is chapter 11 (chapter 10 is now performance maneuvers):
//   https://www.faa.gov/sites/faa.gov/files/regulations_policies/handbooks_manuals/aviation/airplane_handbook/12_afh_ch11.pdf
//   (1.1 and 61.57(b) night periods; rods and cones; night blind spot 5 to 10 degrees; up to 30 minutes; bright light for 1 second or more
